@startuml
class Booking
class BookingService {
  service_type / unit_price / quantity
  subtotal()
}
class AdditionalService
class BreakfastPackage
class AirportTransfer
class RoomUpgrade
class CancellationService
abstract class CancellationPolicy
class FlexibleCancellationPolicy
class PartialRefundCancellationPolicy
class NoRefundCancellationPolicy
Booking "1" o-- "*" BookingService
class AdditionalServicePricing
AdditionalServicePricing ..> BookingService : sums captured subtotals
AdditionalService <|-- BreakfastPackage
AdditionalService <|-- AirportTransfer
RoomUpgrade --> Booking
CancellationService --> Booking
CancellationService --> CancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- FlexibleCancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- PartialRefundCancellationPolicy
CancellationPolicy <|-- NoRefundCancellationPolicy
note bottom of AdditionalService
  Service classes configure name and price.
  BookingService captures these as values;
  there is no object association between them.
end note
@enduml
